  "dedication": "Every photo in here is a moment I never want to forget. This place is yours.",
  "message": "From the first day, you made ordinary things feel like the best part of my life. Slow mornings, long walks, the way you laugh before you finish a joke. I kept every one of them.\n\nI built this place so you can walk through our story whenever you want to. Every room is a day I would live again.\n\nWherever we go next, I only want to go there with you.",
